// Traits, use side. The member lookup (own method, `#[impl]` fn, trait default body: plan 11 B11.3) is
// `trait_call.j3` (`traitMethodCall`, `opFnOf`), the structural satisfaction check `trait_bounds.j3`
// (`checkBoundReqs`), the declaration side `decl_traits.j3`. Nothing lives here until a caller outside a
// body (`dyn` tables, derive: C2c) needs the lookup as a free function over the tables; it then moves
// here from `trait_call.j3`, one copy.
//
// Part of module j3c.sema.
// Port of: check/traits.rs, check/lower/bounds.rs (the lookup order of call.rs / impl_target /
// call_default, and check_bounds' yes/no)
module j3c.sema;
